extends ../layouts/main-template

block vars
    - const header = true;
    - const footer = true;

block title
    title Frequently Asked Questions — Blackgrow

block description
    meta(name='description', content='Answers to common questions about our organic nursery products, orders, shipping, and sustainable materials.')

block content
    section(class='py-12 tablet:py-16')
        div(class='wrapper max-w-4xl')
            header(class='mb-12 text-center')
                h1(class='text-h1 font-normal uppercase tracking-heading text-ink') Frequently Asked Questions
                p(class='mt-3 text-base text-ink-soft') Everything you need to know about our nursery gear, shipping, and materials.

            div(class='space-y-12')
                div(class='rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-6 tablet:p-10')
                    h2(class='mb-6 border-b border-line pb-4 text-h3 font-medium text-ink') Orders &amp; Shipping
                    div(class='space-y-8')
                        div
                            h3(class='text-lg font-semibold text-ink') How long does domestic shipping take?
                            p(class='mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft') Standard orders are processed within 1–2 business days. Ground delivery takes between 3–5 business days depending on your location.
                        div
                            h3(class='text-lg font-semibold text-ink') Can I track my order in real time?
                            p(class='mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft') Yes. Once your package leaves our fulfillment center, you will receive an email confirmation with an active tracking link.
                        div
                            h3(class='text-lg font-semibold text-ink') What is your return and exchange policy?
                            p(class='mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft') We offer a 30-day return policy on all unused items in their original packaging. Return shipping is free for exchanges.

                div(class='rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-6 tablet:p-10')
                    h2(class='mb-6 border-b border-line pb-4 text-h3 font-medium text-ink') Materials &amp; Safety
                    div(class='space-y-8')
                        div
                            h3(class='text-lg font-semibold text-ink') Are all textile products 100% certified organic?
                            p(class='mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft') Every cotton item in our collection is GOTS certified organic, harvested sustainably, and processed without harsh chemical dyes.
                        div
                            h3(class='text-lg font-semibold text-ink') What finishes are used on wooden furniture?
                            p(class='mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft') Our furniture is treated with food-grade plant oils and zero-VOC water-based sealants to ensure complete non-toxic safety.
                        div
                            h3(class='text-lg font-semibold text-ink') How do I care for wooden toys?
                            p(class='mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft') Wipe clean with a damp cloth and mild natural soap. Allow to air dry completely. Do not submerge solid wood toys in water.
